zations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-23T15:22:09Z","updated_at":"2025-10-23T15:22:09Z","body":"I have a fix confirmed locally. Just rebasing on master and then will make a PR","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3437607743/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":3,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3447980618","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111879#issuecomment-3447980618","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111879","id":3447980618,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7NhAJK","user":{"login":"saierXP","id":45038185,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MDM4MTg1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45038185?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/saierXP","html_url":"https://github.com/saierXP","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saierXP/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saierXP/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saierXP/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saierXP/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saierXP/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saierXP/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saierXP/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saierXP/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/saierXP/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-26T03:34:21Z","updated_at":"2025-10-26T03:34:21Z","body":"`Windows 10 (build 19045) dedicated AMD Radeon RX 7800 XT (Version 25.5.1) - 12th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-12400F (12 threads) `\nIt's also an AMD graphics card, but the manifestation of the problem is different. When creating a new project, it causes the system to freeze and hang, making it impossible to perform any operations. Additionally, after turning off the monitor, when you reopen it, It doesn't receive signal and the screen remains black, forcing you to restart the system by pressing the restart button.\n\nClayjohn's fix PR worked for me,my comment are just for supplementing information and recording.\n\nDebugging confirmed that the issue occurs when executing the `--test-rd-support` step for RenderDevice support verification.\nWhen running the command line alone, I noticed that the issue can be fully reproduced under certain conditions:\n\n- First, restart the system and run this command using the normal version of Godot4.6.dev1, then execute the same command with the problematic 4.6dev2, and the system works normally.\n\n- But when the system is restarted and the same command `--test-rd-support --display-driver windows` for 4.6.dev2 is executed first, it causes the system to freeze indefinitely and become unresponsive.\n\n<img width=\"1515\" height=\"925\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/beeaa7dc-123d-4a53-9311-316c6609e11a\" />\n\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3447980618/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]